        <UserObject label="&lt;p class=&quot;ds-markdown-paragraph&quot; style=&quot;margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; margin-left: 0px; color: rgb(15, 17, 21); font-family: quote-cjk-patch, Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &amp;quot;Open Sans&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Linux 内核启动流程中的一个关键步骤，用于&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot;&gt;初始化用于获取高精度时间戳的调度器时钟（sched_clock）&lt;/span&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;transition: box-shadow 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1); border-style: solid; border-color: light-dark(rgba(255, 255, 255, 0), rgba(18, 18, 18, 0)); border-image: none; border-width: 2px 3px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://git.kernel.dk/cgit/linux/log/init?h=v4.20-rc7&amp;amp;id=6ad018e3ca9efd80a724e32c02ae7552fd0829f2&amp;amp;showmsg=1#3&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noreferrer&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(57, 100, 254); transition: box-shadow 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1); border-style: solid; border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0); border-image: none; border-width: 2px 3px; margin-left: -3px; margin-right: -3px; text-decoration: none; position: relative; cursor: default;&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(15, 17, 21), rgb(222, 223, 227));&quot;&gt;它的主要作用是&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(15, 17, 21), rgb(222, 223, 227));&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot;&gt;为&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; font-variant: normal; font-stretch: 100%; line-height: 22px; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-language-override: normal; font-family: Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, &amp;quot;Cascadia Mono&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Ubuntu Mono&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Liberation Mono&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;JetBrains Mono&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Fira Code&amp;quot;, Cousine, &amp;quot;Roboto Mono&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, Courier, sans-serif, system-ui; background-color: rgb(235, 238, 242); border-radius: 6px; align-items: center; padding: 0px 5px; display: inline-flex;&quot;&gt;sched_clock()&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;函数能够提供精确、稳定的时间信息而建立基础&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(15, 17, 21), rgb(222, 223, 227));&quot;&gt;，这对于性能分析、调度延迟测量以及日志时间戳等场景至关重要&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" link="&lt;p class=&quot;ds-markdown-paragraph&quot; style=&quot;margin-top: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; margin-left: 0px; color: rgb(15, 17, 21); font-family: quote-cjk-patch, Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &amp;quot;Open Sans&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Linux 内核启动流程中的一个关键步骤，用于&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-weight: 600;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot;&gt;初始化用于获取高精度时间戳的调度器时钟（sched_clock）&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://git.kernel.dk/cgit/linux/log/init?h=v4.20-rc7&amp;amp;id=6ad018e3ca9efd80a724e32c02ae7552fd0829f2&amp;amp;showmsg=1#3&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noreferrer&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(57, 100, 254); transition: box-shadow 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1); border-style: solid; border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0); border-image: none; border-width: 2px 3px; margin-left: -3px; margin-right: -3px; text-decoration: none; position: relative; cursor: default;&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot;&gt;。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ds-markdown-paragraph&quot; style=&quot;margin: 16px 0px; color: rgb(15, 17, 21); font-family: quote-cjk-patch, Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &amp;quot;Open Sans&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot;&gt;它的主要作用是&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-weight: 600;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot;&gt;为&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; font-stretch: 100%; line-height: 22px; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-language-override: normal; font-family: Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, &amp;quot;Cascadia Mono&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Ubuntu Mono&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Liberation Mono&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;JetBrains Mono&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Fira Code&amp;quot;, Cousine, &amp;quot;Roboto Mono&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, Courier, sans-serif, system-ui; background-color: rgb(235, 238, 242); border-radius: 6px; align-items: center; padding: 0px 5px; display: inline-flex; font-size: 0.875em !important;&quot;&gt;sched_clock()&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;函数能够提供精确、稳定的时间信息而建立基础&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot;&gt;，这对于性能分析、调度延迟测量以及日志时间戳等场景至关重要&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" id="Sgn_1HDSBjQnMq3442AB-150">
