        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(15, 17, 21); font-family: quote-cjk-patch, Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &amp;quot;Open Sans&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;初始化内核的任务凭证（credentials）子系统&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://mirrors.hust.edu.cn/git/linux-stable.git/blame/kernel/cred.c?h=linux-6.12.y&amp;amp;id=5163b583a036b103c3cec7171d6731c125773ed6#1&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noreferrer&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(57, 100, 254); transition: box-shadow 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1); border-style: solid; border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0); border-image: none; border-width: 2px 3px; margin-left: -3px; margin-right: -3px; text-decoration: none; position: relative; font-family: quote-cjk-patch, Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &amp;quot;Open Sans&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); cursor: default;&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(15, 17, 21); font-family: quote-cjk-patch, Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &amp;quot;Open Sans&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;。它创建了一个专用 slab 缓存，用于高效管理&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-stretch: 100%; line-height: 22px; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-language-override: normal; font-family: Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, &amp;quot;Cascadia Mono&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Ubuntu Mono&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Liberation Mono&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;JetBrains Mono&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Fira Code&amp;quot;, Cousine, &amp;quot;Roboto Mono&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, Courier, sans-serif, system-ui; background-color: rgb(235, 238, 242); border-radius: 6px; align-items: center; padding: 0px 5px; display: inline-flex; color: rgb(15, 17, 21); letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;struct cred&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(15, 17, 21); font-family: quote-cjk-patch, Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &amp;quot;Open Sans&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;结构体，并为系统的初始进程（&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-stretch: 100%; line-height: 22px; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-language-override: normal; font-family: Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, &amp;quot;Cascadia Mono&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Ubuntu Mono&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Liberation Mono&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;JetBrains Mono&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Fira Code&amp;quot;, Cousine, &amp;quot;Roboto Mono&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, Courier, sans-serif, system-ui; background-color: rgb(235, 238, 242); border-radius: 6px; align-items: center; padding: 0px 5px; display: inline-flex; color: rgb(15, 17, 21); letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;init_task&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(15, 17, 21); font-family: quote-cjk-patch, Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &amp;quot;Open Sans&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: 