        </UserObject>
        <mxCell id="Sgn_1HDSBjQnMq3442AB-189" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Consolas, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-weight: normal; line-height: 19px; white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;nsfs_init();&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="40" width="130" x="1627.5" y="10015" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Sgn_1HDSBjQnMq3442AB-190" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(15, 17, 21); font-family: quote-cjk-patch, Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &amp;quot;Open Sans&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;初始化“命名空间文件系统”（Namespace Filesystem, nsfs）&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(15, 17, 21); font-family: quote-cjk-patch, Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &amp;quot;Open Sans&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;。这个特殊的虚拟文件系统将内核的命名空间（namespace）以文件形式呈现，为用户空间的程序提供了一种操作和管理命名空间的统一接口&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="80" width="870" x="380" y="9995" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Sgn_1HDSBjQnMq3442AB-191" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Consolas, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; line-height: 19px; white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;pidfs_init();&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="40" width="130" x="1627.5" y="10145" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Sgn_1HDSBjQnMq3442AB-192" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(15, 17, 21); font-family: quote-cjk-patch, Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &amp;quot;Open Sans&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;Linux 内核中用于初始化&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(15, 17, 21); font-family: quote-cjk-patch, Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &amp;quot;Open Sans&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot;&gt;进程ID文件系统（pidfs）&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(15, 17, 21); font-family: quote-cjk-patch, Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &amp;quot;Open Sans&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;的函数。它负责为这个特殊的、用于表示进程的文件系统建立核心的数据结构和挂载点&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="90" width="770" x="380" y="10125" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Sgn_1HDSBjQnMq3442AB-193" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Consolas, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-weight: normal; line-height: 19px; white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;cpuset_init();&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="40" width="140" x="1625" y="10285" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <UserObject label="&lt;p class=&quot;ds-markdown-paragraph&quot; style=&quot;margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; margin-left: 0px; color: rgb(15, 17, 21); font-family: quote-cjk-patch, Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &amp;quot;Open Sans&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Linux 内核&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot;&gt;cpuset&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;子系统的初始化入口，在系统启动早期被调用&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;。它的主要任务是&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot;&gt;创建并初始化根 cpuset (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-stretch: 100%; line-height: 22px; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-language-override: normal; font-family: Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, &amp;quot;Cascadia Mono&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Ubuntu Mono&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Liberation Mono&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;JetBrains Mono&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Fira Code&amp;quot;, Cousine, &amp;quot;Roboto Mono&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, Courier, sans-serif, system-ui; background-color: rgb(235, 238, 242); border-radius: 6px; align-items: center; padding: 0px 5px; display: inline-flex;&quot;&gt;top_cpuset&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;，同时在内核中挂载 cpuset 文件系统，为后续管理 CPU 和内存节点资源奠定基础&lt;/span&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;transition: box-shadow 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1); border-style: solid; border-color: light-dark(rgba(255, 255, 255, 0), rgba(18, 18, 18, 0)); border-image: none; border-width: 2px 3px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://gitlab.arm.com/linux-arm/linux-iv/-/blame/0c28f287aa57e065116731c1e44bedcbc14fd53f/kernel/cpuset.c?page=3&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noreferrer&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(57, 100, 254); transition: box-shadow 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1); border-style: solid; border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0); border-image: none; border-width: 2px 3px; margin-left: -3px; margin-right: -3px; text-decoration: none; position: relative; cursor: default;&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://gitlab.arm.com/linux-arm/linux-iv/-/blame/e5f00f42f35e6f4699f105a3bd56874847cbf72f/kernel/cpuset.c?page=3&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noreferrer&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(57, 100, 254); transition: box-shadow 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1); border-style: solid; border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0); border-image: none; border-width: 2px 3px; margin-left: -3px; margin-right: -3px; text-decoration: none; position: relative; cursor: default;&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(15, 17, 21), rgb(222, 223, 227)); font-variant: normal; box-sizing: border-box; font-stretch: 100%; line-height: 22px; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-language-overr