        </mxCell>
        <UserObject label="&lt;p class=&quot;ds-markdown-paragraph&quot; style=&quot;margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; margin-left: 0px; color: rgb(15, 17, 21); font-family: quote-cjk-patch, Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &amp;quot;Open Sans&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;KCSAN (Kernel Concurrency Sanitizer，内核并发消毒剂)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;子系统的初始化入口&lt;/span&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;transition: box-shadow 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1); border-style: solid; border-color: light-dark(rgba(255, 255, 255, 0), rgba(18, 18, 18, 0)); border-image: none; border-width: 2px 3px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://git.armlinux.org.uk/cgit/linux.git/commit/init/init_task.c?id=dfd402a4c4baae42398ce9180ff424d589b8bffc&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noreferrer&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(57, 100, 254); transition: box-shadow 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1); border-style: solid; border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0); border-image: none; border-width: 2px 3px; margin-left: -3px; margin-right: -3px; text-decoration: none; position: relative; cursor: default;&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;。KCSAN 是一个用于检测内核中&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot;&gt;数据竞争 (data race)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;的动态工具&lt;/span&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;transition: box-shadow 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1); border-style: solid; border-color: light-dark(rgba(255, 255, 255, 0), rgba(18, 18, 18, 0)); border-image: none; border-width: 2px 3px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://git.armlinux.org.uk/cgit/linux.git/commit/init/init_task.c?id=dfd402a4c4baae42398ce9180ff424d589b8bffc&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noreferrer&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(57, 100, 254); transition: box-shadow 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1); border-style: solid; border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0); border-image: none; border-width: 2px 3px; margin-left: -3px; margin-right: -3px; text-decoration: none; position: relative; cursor: default;&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(18, 18, 18)); color: light-dark(rgb(15, 17, 21), rgb(222, 223, 227));&quot;&gt;该函数负责在系统启动的特定阶段完成 KCSAN 核心数据结构的初始化，使其开始工作&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" link="&lt;p class=&quot;ds-markdown-paragraph&quot; style=&quot;margin-top: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; margin-left: 0px; color: rgb(15, 17, 21); font-family: quote-cjk-patch, Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &amp;quot;Open Sans&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-weight: 600;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot;&gt;KCSAN (Kernel Concurrency Sanitizer，内核并发消毒剂)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;子系统的初始化入口&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://git.armlinux.org.uk/cgit/linux.git/commit/init/init_task.c?id=dfd402a4c4baae42398ce9180ff424d589b8bffc&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noreferrer&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(57, 100, 254); transition: box-shadow 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1); border-style: solid; border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0); border-image: none; border-width: 2px 3px; margin-left: -3px; margin-right: -3px; text-decoration: none; position: relative; cursor: default;&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot;&gt;。KCSAN 是一个用于检测内核中&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-weight: 600;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot;&gt;数据竞争 (data race)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;的动态工具&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://git.armlinux.org.uk/cgit/linux.git/commit/init/init_task.c?id=dfd402a4c4baae42398ce9180ff424d589b8bffc&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noreferrer&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(57, 100, 254); transition: box-shadow 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1); border-style: solid; border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0); border-image: none; border-width: 2px 3px; margin-left: -3px; margin-right: -3px; text-decoration: none; position: relative; cursor: default;&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot;&gt;。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ds-markdown-paragraph&quot; style=&quot;margin: 16px 0px; color: rgb(15, 17, 21); font-family: quote-cjk-patch, Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &amp;quot;Open Sans&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot;&gt;该函数负责在系统启动的特定阶段完成 KCSAN 核心数据结构的初始化，使其开始工作&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://lkml.iu.edu/hypermail/linux/kernel/1910.2/02364.html#3&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noreferrer&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(57, 100, 254); transition: box-shadow 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1); border-style: solid; border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0); border-image: none; border-width: 2px 3px; margin-left: -3px; margin-right: -3px; text-decoration: none; position: relative; cursor: default;&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" id="Sgn_1HDSBjQnMq3442AB-208">
